[{"title":"七里驿遇叶振卿秘校南归三首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"雪霰飘灯春夜长，相逢旅琐莫悲伤。\n朱颜绿发输君少，正好驱车上太行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4736,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七里驿遇叶振卿秘校南归三首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"系马邮亭寂寞中，远沙乔木暮号风。\n今宵不作江南梦，赖有之人笑语同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4737,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月十四日小会","author":"孔武仲","text":"带露葵花贮漆盘，周遭仍簇小鸡冠。\n人生爱赏无时足，但作姚黄魏紫看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4738,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入山三首 其三","author":"孔武仲","text":"十岁不出还可嗟，经旬遍走梵王家。\n群仙拍手向人笑，方朔今来何晚耶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4739,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入山三首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"冠盖成阴中路回，独携莲社道人来。\n千岩万壑初相识，分付晴岚面面开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4740,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入湘江二绝句 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"清川曲岸进迟迟，采得菊花三两枝。\n撚弄秋香斜日下，有怀江国去年时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4741,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入湘江二绝句 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"平沙衬水竹藏云，自古多招薄命人。\n我独远来追所好，是中鱼美绿醅醇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4742,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入鄢陵界","author":"孔武仲","text":"马蹄腾踏去如流，雨止车尘凝不浮。\n驿道夷平桑柘美，人言从此属皇州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4743,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又三绝句 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"风定南溪映碧虚，扁舟选胜百蟠纡。\n荇花荷叶明人眼，犹记当年入镜湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4744,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又三绝句 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"咫尺齐山不易登，力驱烦冗得身轻。\n瑶巅珉洞须寻遍，从此乘风上玉京。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4745,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又三绝句 其三","author":"孔武仲","text":"旧游萧索十年馀，走遍东南雪满须。\n醉洒银钩题岁月，窥寻犹在壁间无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4746,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三山矶","author":"孔武仲","text":"矶下长川欲倒流，江豚出没水禽浮。\n凭谁为告诗仙道，今到青天尽处游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4747,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大业二绝 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"西苑池塘涸海流，君王十骑月中游。\n蛾眉排户争新宠，不道迷藏自有楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4748,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大业二绝 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"杳杳扬州只隔淮，龙舟彩舸映天来。\n春风咫尺伊川路，不放君王殿脚回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4749,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大热归城西止于兴国戒坛院","author":"孔武仲","text":"红尘迎马尽飞浮，日脚横天凝不流。\n金碧峥嵘凉意动，归轩聊作化城游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4750,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山间三首 其三","author":"孔武仲","text":"柔条细叶谩成丛，亦有悬崖出小红。\n欲试金丹求不死，灵苗应在此山中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4751,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山间三首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"绝壁藤萝喜可攀，更无平地只青山。\n路回亦有虚明处，江北江南指掌间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4752,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山间三首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"江城八月苦炎晖，潇洒山间挟纩时。\n峰顶宝林俱胜绝，篮舆从此上天池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4753,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马上有作","author":"孔武仲","text":"宫城北转乱蝉嘶，乔木阴云水满陂。\n一阵风来掠华鬓，江湖清兴有谁知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4754,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书怀","author":"孔武仲","text":"昨寄家书道苦长，南州山迥水茫茫。\n细将驿堠从头数，准拟今朝到故乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4755,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事二首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"北来烟爨苦凄凉，金灶峥嵘突尾长。\n满箧香粳无处用，邮亭一饱待桄榔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4756,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事二首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"路逢行客向江州，勒马荒郊为少留。\n家事满怀无纸写，好将言语付苍头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4757,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五鼓乘风过洞庭湖日高已至庙下作诗三篇 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"半掩船篷天淡明，飞帆已背岳阳城。\n飘然一叶乘空度，卧听银潢泻月声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4758,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"从太守黄公登西湖待月台","author":"孔武仲","text":"星斗垂天月淡明，九衢歌鼓乐升平。\n当时常侍传呼处，只有荒陂凫雁声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4759,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凤凰陂","author":"孔武仲","text":"长陂寂寞断鸱鸦，浩浩春风马鬣斜。\n待得春霖添水满，只应从此却还家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4760,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"成化县二首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"登览多清兴，衣襟有白云。\n松风不知际，仙籁坐中闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4761,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"成化县二首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"化成真化出，绝险起朱栏。\n直下临无处，江城一掬看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4762,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长芦五绝句 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"吴楚中间天杳茫，愁霖倾卷水洋洋。\n千帆渡口低鹏翼，海阔风微不敢翔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4763,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长芦五绝句 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"扁舟昨出国门东，烦暑端如坐甑中。\n一雨一凉皆可喜，只嗔三日打头风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4764,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长芦五绝句 其四","author":"孔武仲","text":"波声滚滚百川流，七日津亭厌舣舟。\n遥望丛祠烧的乳，美风相遣莫淹留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4765,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长芦五绝句 其五","author":"孔武仲","text":"去尽江湾伴侣船，整帆徐出浦沙边。\n风涛沃日心弥壮，老矣无因似昔年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4766,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长芦五绝句 其三","author":"孔武仲","text":"白雾应连沧海东，邻舟相失渺茫中。\n时时客子江头语，社过应须有好风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4767,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出京","author":"孔武仲","text":"整顿归装夜不眠，篮舆出趁早凉天。\n东南爽气来相逼，叶底初闻一片蝉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4768,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发加禄","author":"孔武仲","text":"白草萧萧漾早晖，篮舆轻稳去如飞。\n淮天软暖多成雨，喜有轻寒犯客衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4769,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归宗寺","author":"孔武仲","text":"海会寮中略问禅，高僧刚道语难传。\n却询耶舍罗那事，俯仰人间七百年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4770,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉渊亭龙潭","author":"孔武仲","text":"清潭千古照悬崖，崖上飞流动地来。\n咫尺语言闻不得，夕阳佳景更徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4771,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"田间","author":"孔武仲","text":"百顷陂田过雨清，新秧漠漠似苔生。\n津梁只欲凭忠信，南去无心问耦耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4772,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白鹤观","author":"孔武仲","text":"洞天人远矣，琳馆有遗踪。\n愿弃人间事，优游慕赤松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4773,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春日","author":"孔武仲","text":"开岁春寒便有花，官閒只饮酒如霞。\n殿门促贺新幡胜，书馆年来事事嘉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4774,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"关山五首 其五","author":"孔武仲","text":"山溪百转水泠泠，栽插新秧次第成。\n风赶绿茸无断处，他时粒粒是香粳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4775,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"关山五首 其四","author":"孔武仲","text":"北地樵苏寸草空，不如烧炭此山中。\n良材合抱随斤斧，岂顾区区栎与枫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4776,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"关山五首 其三","author":"孔武仲","text":"少妇织新丝，人来不下机。\n斜阳过茅屋，郎亦采樵归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4777,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"关山五首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"岭尽还临水，溪穷又有山。\n人游明镜里，鸟语白云间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4778,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"关山五首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"晓上春风第一楂，豁然披眼尽天涯。\n原田极望人稀少，掩映茅篁数十家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4779,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"关山路三首 其三","author":"孔武仲","text":"马力虺隤苦不禁，仆夫流汗亦沾襟。\n抱琴来写非无意，爱此山高涧水深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4780,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"关山路三首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"晨朝马匹涉崎岖，映水梅花尚一株。\n旬日山川历千里，江南雪蕊己全无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4781,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"关山路三首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"朝来晴色颇鲜妍，最爱群峰雪皓然。\n驻马折梅看皎洁，临流照影弄潺湲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4782,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早朝遇执政于路","author":"孔武仲","text":"红烛转沙堤，天门仗未齐。\n槐阴勒马待，月在御沟西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4783,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗四首 其四","author":"孔武仲","text":"利绾名驱夜废眠，王城车马日喧阗。\n谁知坦腹春风里，醉卧墙阴不计年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4784,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗四首 其三","author":"孔武仲","text":"霞冠鹤氅一道士，梦半留丹三四粒。\n云是月华宫里人，掌心微带银波湿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4785,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗四首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"平日扁舟千里行，朅来无地濯尘缨。\n朝衣趁晓东华路，喜有官桥流水声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4786,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗四首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"春风仰屋卧田庐，海日鲜明柳影疏。\n梦觉不知身处所，此中依约是华胥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4787,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂题二首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"曲涧低泉左右鸣，步虚宫殿响琚珩。\n清风杳不知来处，散入松间作凤笙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4788,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂题二首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"青青矗矗水萦回，散入溪田媚复哀。\n天上清音难猝记，兹游悔不负琴来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4789,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次无咎凝祥春游三首 其三","author":"孔武仲","text":"奉灵池馆锁幽深，遗迹凄凉故老心。\n维岳云车时一下，直疑弦管有来音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4790,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次无咎凝祥春游三首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"浴日池光初炯炯，三春禽语已关关。\n珍台閒馆波涛接，太液昆明伯仲间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4791,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次无咎凝祥春游三首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"芸编校罢得嬉游，池馆虽春爽似秋。\n同舍病郎追不及，喜传佳句到瀛洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4792,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和王敏仲望祝融峰四首 其四","author":"孔武仲","text":"僧居晓看一峰青，迥绝纤尘点画屏。\n会有片云来触石，江湖三日雨冥冥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4793,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和王敏仲望祝融峰四首 其三","author":"孔武仲","text":"南帝尊严敕六丁，剜湘为砚岳为屏。\n照青叠秀俱来会，惟有中峰在杳冥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4794,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和王敏仲望祝融峰四首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"斗柄峥嵘宜有概，星榆烂漫岂无根。\n祝融直上应窥见，阊阖虽重亦可扪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4795,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和王敏仲望祝融峰四首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"独立千秋浑不倚，排虚直上似无根。\n履穿尚恐高难及，磴滑犹应险可扪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4796,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州山","author":"孔武仲","text":"水际天边尽画屏，广寒宫阙玉为城。\n南来已为江山助，到此逢山眼更明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4797,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自归宗入灵溪观 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"石桥横路水溅溅，百尺琳宫馆列仙。\n闻有秦人来避世，至今修竹上参天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4798,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自归宗入灵溪观 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"紫霄峰下有禅林，瓦结青瑶地布金。\n闻道灵溪才咫尺，携筇不觉后山深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4799,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至赵庄镇舍轿乘马二首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"晴郊漠漠翠烟浮，乘兴閒登枣下骝。\n风色斗回成凛冽，却添貂帽拥驼裘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4800,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至新息寄四弟","author":"孔武仲","text":"江上分飞已隔年，春风初转月初圆。\n今宵相望长淮北，只有星河共一天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4801,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至新息寄信州王守","author":"孔武仲","text":"熙熙乐国似登台，北圃南亭春事催。\n惆怅音尘难再会，瑞香应已绕檐开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4802,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西园独步二首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"茂林新幄翠重重，犹有残花掩映红。\n庭馆渐虚容散涉，时攀园果作狙公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4803,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阳罗矶","author":"孔武仲","text":"石壮山狞不可干，倾江波浪作惊湍。\n残霞一抺吴天晚，正苦扁舟不上滩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4804,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"何君表留大舟于浔阳不敢乘既至湘阴寄绝句谢之","author":"孔武仲","text":"洞庭秋水接天流，万斛楼航不易收。\n才力似君方称副，此身只合载渔舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4805,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听蝉","author":"孔武仲","text":"畏日流金不断声，松风涧水助泠泠。\n我来萧散无馀事，得倚篮舆细细听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4806,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴章岭作","author":"孔武仲","text":"庐山北转是吴章，岩草纷纷静有香。\n洞口流泉似相送，人间天上莫相忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4807,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"折县道中二首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"紫沙随马细如筛，虎阜龙冈尽此驰。\n正望长安不回首，行人休赋灞陵诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4808,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"折县道中二首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"柳堤桃坞未怡融，浣濯新梢上浅红。\n一段春光来逼眼，枣骝嘶入柏林中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4809,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈翰林游天池约相会于栖贤久之不至","author":"孔武仲","text":"庐阜西头是谪仙，篮舆正欲上青天。\n霓旌羽盖何时返，怅望洪崖阻拍肩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4810,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和竹元珍夜雨","author":"孔武仲","text":"帝城尘土热如汤，喜有残宵雨送凉。\n旅枕梦云萦宋玉，空阶诗思感何郎。\n香迷旧径烟初断，灯倚轻寒焰不长。\n明日御沟应更好，一番晴色弄垂杨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4811,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝应界中绝句三首 其三","author":"孔武仲","text":"淮天秋日下，水国晚凉中。\n舟子趋程意，轩轩欲贯虹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4812,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝应界中绝句三首 其二","author":"孔武仲","text":"泉水秋浮艇，荒陂暮听蝉。\n登瀛从此路，出守已衰年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4813,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝应界中绝句三首 其一","author":"孔武仲","text":"倒景虞渊日，馀威泽国霞。\n宵行逐明月，水宿傍人家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4814,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]